Autonomous Mobile Robot Software Architecture (ROS 2 – “nav2” based)
Below is a complete, production grade architecture for a differential drive robot equipped with a 2 D LiDAR.
It is expressed in ROS 2 Foxy/Fortress (any later distribution works the same) and uses the Nav2 stack as the core navigation backbone, extended with a few custom nodes for mission handling, safety, and diagnostics.
