3. Core Topics (Message Types & Direction)
Topic	Message Type	Publisher(s)	Subscriber(s)
/scan	sensor_msgs/msg/LaserScan	laser_filter_node (raw LiDAR driver) → filtered scan	amcl, costmap_2d (local), laser_filter_node (if re publishing)
/odom	nav_msgs/msg/Odometry	Wheel odometry driver (e.g., diff_drive_controller or robot_localization raw source)	sensor_fusion (robot_localization)
/odometry/fused	nav_msgs/msg/Odometry	sensor_fusion (robot_localization)	amcl, planner_server (optional), controller_server
/amcl_pose	geometry_msgs/msg/PoseWithCovarianceStamped	amcl	bt_navigator, rviz2, any UI
/particlecloud	geometry_msgs/msg/PoseArray	amcl	Debug/visualisation
/map	nav_msgs/msg/OccupancyGrid	map_server	amcl, costmap_2d (global), rviz2
/tf	tf2_msgs/msg/TFMessage	tf2_static_transform_publisher, all nodes that broadcast TF (e.g., amcl publishes map→odom)	Everyone that needs transforms
/tf_static	tf2_msgs/msg/TFMessage	static_transform_publisher	All
/global_costmap/costmap	nav2_msgs/msg/Costmap	costmap_2d (global)	planner_server
/local_costmap/costmap	nav2_msgs/msg/Costmap	costmap_2d (local)	controller_server
/plan	nav_msgs/msg/Path	planner_server	controller_server, bt_navigator
/cmd_vel	geometry_msgs/msg/Twist	controller_server (or safety_stop if engaged)	diff_drive_controller
/cmd_vel_left, /cmd_vel_right	std_msgs/msg/Float64	diff_drive_controller (translates Twist)	Wheel motor drivers (CAN/serial)
/goal_pose	geometry_msgs/msg/PoseStamped	goal_pose_server (via action/ service)	bt_navigator (starts navigation)
/navigate_to_pose	nav2_msgs/action/NavigateToPose	bt_navigator (action server)	UI/mission client
/diagnostics	diagnostic_msgs/msg/DiagnosticArray	All nodes (via diagnostics_aggregator)	diagnostics_aggregator, rviz2
/estop	std_msgs/msg/Bool	Emergency hardware, UI	safety_stop
QoS notes:
•	/scan and /odom use sensor data QoS (reliable=false, depth=10).
•	/cmd_vel uses best effort, keep last=1 to guarantee latest command.
•	/map, /global_costmap/*, /local_costmap/* use reliable, transient_local (so late joining nodes get the latest map).
