5. Recommended Launch & Configuration Structure
markdownCopy
launch/
│   nav2_bringup.launch.py          # composable container, lifecycle manager
│   robot_state_publisher.launch.py # static TFs + URDF
│   safety.launch.py                # estop & watchdog
│   diagnostics.launch.py           # diagnostics aggregator
│   ui.launch.py                    # optional rqt/rviz
config/
│   robot.yaml          # robot description (footprint, wheel radius, etc.)
│   nav2_params.yaml    # all Nav2 parameters (planner, controller, costmap)
│   amcl_params.yaml
│   ekf.yaml            # robot_localization
│   map.yaml            # path to .pgm + metadata
│   safety.yaml         # estop topics, timeout values
Key parameter highlights
Parameter	Reason
controller_server → DWB plugin with velocity_scaling_factor=0.5 (smooth in tight aisles)	
costmap_2d → inflation_layer radius = robot radius + 0.1 m	
amcl → particle_filter count = 500 (good trade off for indoor maps)	
planner_server → SmacPlannerHybrid with allow_unknown = false	
bt_navigator → recovery sequence: clear_costmap → rotate_in_place → backtrack	
robot_state_publisher → use_sim_time = false (real hardware)	
safety_stop → estop_timeout = 0.1 s (hard stop)	
