6. Production Ready Extras (optional but recommended)
Feature	Node / Package	Why it matters
Health monitoring	nav2_lifecycle_manager + custom watchdog	Auto restart nodes if any lifecycle fails.
Logging & Replay	rosbag2 (record /scan, /odom, /amcl_pose, /cmd_vel)	Post mortem analysis of incidents.
Remote monitoring	ros2_web_bridge + web UI	Operators can see pose, map, and issue goals from a browser.
Dynamic Reconfiguration	dynamic_params (rclcpp::parameter_event)	Tune controller gains on the fly without restart.
Security	DDS security (SROS2)	Authenticate UI and remote operators.
Simulation	nav2_simulation launch (Gazebo or Ignition)	CI pipeline runs navigation tests in headless mode.
Testing	ament_lint, ament_uncrustify, launch_testing	Enforce code style and verify launch order.
